**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/Debug
**/Release
# One folder per use case, and one of the use cases is called Release (ADR 0052). The line above is
# right for `bin/Release` and `obj/Release` and wrong here: it kept two source files out of the
# build context, so the CQRS image failed to compile on a type that did not exist. `.gitignore`
# carries the same exception, learned the same way. Re-included by exact path rather than by
# wildcard, so it stays as narrow as the collision that caused it.
!src/DDDWithCqrs/Application/Features/Trainings/Release
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.md
**/tests
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/docker-compose*.yaml
**/.dockerignore
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.pfx
